Hi Julia,

there is no really good measure of this type for categorical DVs. That's
one answer you could give to the reviewer (see e.g., Agresti 2002 for the
various problems with the measures that have been proposed). For what it's
worth R2 are even problematic for mixed *linear* models.

With that disclaimer in mind, you can concoct a Nagelkerke R2 measure for
mixed models (if you download my 2010 Cognitive Psychology paper and search
for that term, you'll find a footnote with a link to some code ... that
hopefully still works; plus caveats about this method). Like you, I was
asked by reviewers to add it.

Florian

